problem_statement:
Let {an } and                                                                             2     2
               p {bn } be sequences defined recursively by a0 = 2; b0 = 2, and an+1 = an 1 + an + bn −bn ;
    bn+1 = bn 1 + a2n + b2n + an . Find the ternary (base 3) representation of a4 and b4 .

